{"seq":1,"slug":"crispr-gene-editing","title":"研究生 分子生物学 — CRISPR 基因编辑","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/techniques/crispr-gene-editing","wordCount":1357,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-分子生物学-crispr-基因编辑\">研究生 分子生物学 — CRISPR 基因编辑</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>CRISPR-Cas9 基因编辑技术是21世纪生命科学最具变革性的工具，它使得研究者可以在几乎任何生物体中精确地修改基因组序列。从基础研究中的基因功能分析到临床治疗中的遗传疾病纠正，CRISPR 技术的应用范围不断扩大。2020年 Nobel 化学奖授予了 Jennifer Doudna 和 Emmanuelle Charpentier，以表彰她们对 CRISPR-Cas9 技术的开创性贡献。</p>\n<p>核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cas9 核酸酶</strong>：由 sgRNA 引导切割双链 DNA 的内切核酸酶</li>\n<li><strong>sgRNA（single guide RNA）</strong>：20 nt 靶向序列 + 支架结构，引导 Cas9 到特定基因组位置</li>\n<li><strong>PAM 序列</strong>：Cas9 识别的前间隔序列邻近基序（SpCas9 识别 5&#39;-NGG-3&#39;）</li>\n<li><strong>DSB 修复</strong>：非同源末端连接（NHEJ）→ 插入缺失；同源定向修复（HDR）→ 精确编辑</li>\n<li><strong>碱基编辑和先导编辑</strong>：不产生双链断裂的精确编辑技术</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"crispr-cas-系统的生物学起源\">CRISPR-Cas 系统的生物学起源</h3><p>CRISPR（Clustered Regularly Interspaced Short Palindromic Repeats）是细菌和古菌的适应性免疫系统。</p>\n<p><strong>免疫机制</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>适应（Adaptation）</strong>：将入侵噬菌体 DNA 片段整合为新的间隔序列</li>\n<li><strong>表达（Expression）</strong>：转录 CRISPR 阵列并加工为 crRNA</li>\n<li><strong>干扰（Interference）</strong>：crRNA 引导 Cas 蛋白切割入侵 DNA</li>\n</ol>\n<p>CRISPR 系统分为 Class 1（多亚基效应复合物）和 Class 2（单蛋白效应器）。Cas9（II 型）和 Cas12a（V 型）属于 Class 2，最适合基因编辑应用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cas9-的分子机制\">Cas9 的分子机制</h3><p><strong>sgRNA 设计</strong>：将天然的 crRNA 和 tracrRNA 融合为单一引导 RNA。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sgRNA</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mtext>20 nt 靶向序列</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>与基因组互补</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>支架序列</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>结合 Cas9</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sgRNA} = \\underbrace{\\text{20 nt 靶向序列}}_{\\text{与基因组互补}} + \\underbrace{\\text{支架序列}}_{\\text{结合 Cas9}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sgRNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">与基因组互补</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">20 nt </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">靶向序列</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">结合</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> Cas9</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">支架序列</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>切割过程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Cas9-sgRNA 复合物扫描基因组，识别 PAM 序列（NGG）</li>\n<li>DNA 解旋，sgRNA 与靶链配对形成 R-loop</li>\n<li>RuvC 和 HNH 核酸酶结构域分别切割两条链</li>\n<li>在 PAM 上游 3 bp 处产生平端双链断裂（DSB）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"dsb-修复与基因编辑结果\">DSB 修复与基因编辑结果</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>修复途径</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NHEJ</td>\n<td>不需要模板，引入随机 indel</td>\n<td>基因敲除（移码突变）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HDR</td>\n<td>需要供体模板，精确修复</td>\n<td>基因敲入、点突变纠正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MMEJ</td>\n<td>微同源末端连接</td>\n<td>可预测的缺失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>HDR 效率提升策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>小分子抑制 NHEJ（如 SCR7 抑制 DNA Ligase IV）</li>\n<li>使用 ssODN（单链寡核苷酸）供体</li>\n<li>细胞周期同步到 S/G2 期（HDR 仅在此期活跃）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"碱基编辑器\">碱基编辑器</h3><p><strong>胞嘧啶碱基编辑器（CBE）</strong>：dCas9/nCas9-APOBEC 融合蛋白，实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\cdot G \\to T \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 转换，无需双链断裂。</p>\n<p><strong>腺嘌呤碱基编辑器（ABE）</strong>：dCas9/nCas9-进化的 TadA 融合蛋白，实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\cdot T \\to G \\cdot C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 转换。</p>\n<p>碱基编辑器无需 DSB 和供体模板，效率高（30-80%），旁切效应低，特别适合点突变疾病的纠正。</p>\n<h3 id=\"先导编辑-prime-editing\">先导编辑（Prime Editing）</h3><p><strong>原理</strong>：nCas9（H840A）融合逆转录酶，使用 pegRNA（含引导序列 + 逆转录模板）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>pegRNA</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>sgRNA</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>引物结合位点（PBS）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>逆转录模板（RT template）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pegRNA} = \\text{sgRNA} + \\text{引物结合位点（PBS）} + \\text{逆转录模板（RT template）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pegRNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sgRNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">引物结合位点（</span><span class=\"mord\">PBS</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">逆转录模板（</span><span class=\"mord\">RT template</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>先导编辑可以实现所有12种碱基替换、小片段插入和缺失，被称为&quot;搜索并替换&quot;编辑器。</p>\n<h3 id=\"临床应用与伦理\">临床应用与伦理</h3><p><strong>已批准的基因编辑疗法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Casgevy（exagamglogene autotemcel）</strong>：2023年首个获批的 CRISPR 疗法，治疗镰状细胞病和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-地中海贫血</li>\n<li><strong>体外编辑</strong>：编辑患者自体造血干细胞后回输</li>\n<li><strong>体内编辑</strong>：脂质纳米颗粒（LNP）递送 Cas9 mRNA 和 sgRNA 至肝脏（如 NTLA-2001 治疗转甲状腺素蛋白淀粉样变性）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>脱靶效应</strong>：sgRNA 可能在基因组中与非靶位点不完全匹配处产生编辑。检测方法包括 GUIDE-seq、CIRCLE-seq、DISCOVER-seq。</p>\n<p><strong>伦理问题</strong>：2018年&quot;基因编辑婴儿事件&quot;引发了全球对人类生殖系编辑的伦理讨论。科学界普遍共识是：目前不应将生殖系编辑用于临床。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一对 sgRNA 来敲除某基因的第3个外显子（提示：在外显子两侧各设计一个 sgRNA）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 CRISPR-Cas9、ZFN 和 TALEN 三种基因编辑工具的优缺点。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么碱基编辑器比传统 Cas9 编辑更适合纠正点突变疾病？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论 CRISPR 体内递送的主要挑战（免疫原性、组织特异性、递送效率）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>从科学和伦理角度讨论：人类生殖系基因编辑应该被允许吗？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Doudna &amp; Sternberg《A Crack in Creation》是 CRISPR 发现故事的科普佳作。</li>\n<li>Jinek et al. (2012) &quot;A programmable dual-RNA-guided DNA endonuclease&quot; 是 CRISPR 编辑的奠基论文。</li>\n<li>Anzalone et al. (2019) &quot;Search-and-replace genome editing without double-strand breaks&quot; 是先导编辑的原始论文。</li>\n<li>Addgene 网站提供了 CRISPR 工具的全面资源和协议。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CRISPR-Cas9 通过 sgRNA 引导的 DNA 切割实现了基因组的可编程编辑。NHEJ 和 HDR 两种修复途径分别支持基因敲除和精确编辑。碱基编辑器和先导编辑器进一步提高了编辑精度并扩大了可实现的编辑类型。从首个 CRISPR 疗法的获批到体内编辑的临床试验，基因编辑技术正在从实验室工具转化为治疗遗传疾病的实际手段。但脱靶效应、递送效率和伦理问题仍是该领域面临的重要挑战。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 分子生物学 — CRISPR 基因编辑","id":"研究生-分子生物学-crispr-基因编辑"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"CRISPR-Cas 系统的生物学起源","id":"crispr-cas-系统的生物学起源"},{"level":3,"text":"Cas9 的分子机制","id":"cas9-的分子机制"},{"level":3,"text":"DSB 修复与基因编辑结果","id":"dsb-修复与基因编辑结果"},{"level":3,"text":"碱基编辑器","id":"碱基编辑器"},{"level":3,"text":"先导编辑（Prime Editing）","id":"先导编辑-prime-editing"},{"level":3,"text":"临床应用与伦理","id":"临床应用与伦理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 系统生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/cell-signaling/systems-biology"},"next":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 新一代测序技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/techniques/next-gen-sequencing"}}